{"channelId":"UCBxKYA5hs8BerdEBLiMKNrA","row":["CryoConcepts, LP - Leaders In Portable Cryosurgery",644,"CryoConcepts is the global leader in portable cryosurgery which is used to treat a wide range of benign skin lesions.  We serve customers in the physician's office, veterinary, and medical/day spa markets who require cryo solutions that are safe, effective, and easy to use.\n\nWe provide a wide range of cryo devices from desk-top cryo units to ultra-portable pen-like devices, and we serve customers in over 40 countries. CryoConcepts is dedicated to being \"All Things Cryo\" and is committed to innovation and bringing technologies to the market that are environmentally sustainable.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBxKYA5hs8BerdEBLiMKNrA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBxKYA5hs8BerdEBLiMKNrA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:10.313Z","channelId":"UCBxKYA5hs8BerdEBLiMKNrA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"9d818f256752ffeddb0d6f6a79927692968415e068140bb79bd390b25dbcbae2","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"f4ba77f67693b8573086cd16d1450b984cb9583370d43dc211ea117493d80d2b"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBxKYA5hs8BerdEBLiMKNrA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:10.313Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBxKYA5hs8BerdEBLiMKNrA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":644,"raw":"644 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBxKYA5hs8BerdEBLiMKNrA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:10.313Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinary","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nDKDFb0Qcls"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。"